# Marang River Regent's Omen, Coil and Catch, is an instant (CR 720.3a: only the Omen's characteristics are evaluated
# to cast it), so Bot1 casts it from the hand in Bot2's upkeep for {3}{U}, though the Regent itself is a creature. On
# the stack it is Coil and Catch. "Draw three cards, then discard a card": Bot1 draws the Plains, Swamp and Forest on top
# of its library and discards the Swamp. Then it is shuffled into Bot1's library (CR 720.3d): eleven cards less three plus
# one, nine.

